// Quint target (017.4): every kind of state change the model carries, checked step by step
// against the evaluator in both modes: create with and without expiry, terminate, a create
// that beats a terminate in the same act, an integer component, an event, a held starting
// state, and an act that occurs but is void.
//! explore-domain: duration = 2
Fact member Identified by Ann, Bob.
Fact slot Identified by 1, 2.
Fact booked Identified by member * slot.
Fact hall Identified by Main.
Fact frozen Identified by hall.
Fact warned Identified by member.

Act book Actor member Related to slot
  Holds when !(Exists member': booked(member', slot))
  Valid when !frozen(Main)
  Creates booked(member, slot) For 2.

Act cancel Actor member Related to slot
  Holds when booked(member, slot)
  Terminates booked(member, slot)
  Creates warned(member).

Act renew Actor member Related to slot
  Holds when booked(member, slot)
  Terminates booked(member, slot)
  Creates booked(member, slot).

Event freeze
  Creates frozen(Main).

Event thaw
  Terminates frozen(Main).

Invariant one-member-per-slot
  When (Forall slot, member, member':
          !(booked(member, slot) && booked(member', slot) && member != member')).

book(Ann, 1).
